+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` with `{"toOrgId":"globex"}` moves a
+user (for example between group companies).
+
+- The caller must belong to `{orgID}`. Callers of other organizations, and
+  unknown organizations, get 404.
+- Only org admins of `{orgID}` may transfer its users. Other members get 403.
+- The user must belong to `{orgID}`, otherwise 404.
+- The move removes the user's memberships in projects of other organizations
+  and unassigns the tasks they held there, so the membership and assignee
+  rules still hold. This applies to archived projects too.
+- The user's org admin flag is cleared: admin rights do not carry over.
+
